{"id":"6e500b8443915190","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-order11-meet-semilattice.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Meet Semilattice","display":"df-zfc-order11-meet-semilattice — ZFC Order11 Meet Semilattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-meet-semilattice","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-meet-semilattice"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-meet-semilattice — ZFC Order11 Meet Semilattice","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","[[58-df-zfc-order2-infimum]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-meet-semilattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-meet-semilattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-meet-semilattice — ZFC Order11 Meet Semilattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bad662f9e2c57951\" href=\"?note=bad662f9e2c57951\" title=\"58-df-zfc-order2-infimum\">58-df-zfc-order2-infimum</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in V\">\\(P\\in V\\)</span> (poset carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (partial order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in P\">\\(x,y\\in P\\)</span> (elements bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S\\)</span> (partial-order and infimum predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MeetSemilattice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MeetSemilattice}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}meet\\text{-}semilattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MeetSemilattice}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\exists m\\in P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(m,\\{x,y\\},P,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}meet\\text{-}semilattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MeetSemilattice}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\exists m\\in P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(m,\\{x,y\\},P,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order guard is explicit even when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\varnothing\">\\(P=\\varnothing\\)</span>; the pairwise clause then supplies the binary greatest lower bounds through the registered infimum predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-order2-infimum","status":"resolved","id":"bad662f9e2c57951","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-order2-infimum]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MeetSemilattice}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}meet\\text{-}semilattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MeetSemilattice}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\exists m\\in P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(m,\\{x,y\\},P,\\leq_P)","display":true},{"tex":"P=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1159,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2892","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-order11-meet-semilattice.md|58-df-zfc-order11-meet-semilattice]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5","bad662f9e2c57951"]}